  "details": "In cases where grabbing or clicking something in-game conflicts with clicking or grabbing something in-overlay, resolving this is essentially an all-or-nothing proposition of interact-with-both, or wholesale blocking of interaction.\n\nIf VRChat were to allow overlays to subscribe to OSC notifications when a grab or a click is eligible to be consumed by VRChat, then the overlays could conditionally disable interactions to give VRChat priority, instead of double-triggering or forcing interactions to be disabled.",
